# protobuf/

Source of truth for all Udex API types and service contracts. All server implementations, client SDKs, and CLI tooling are generated from these files. Proto definitions are compiled by `projects/rust/api/build.rs` using `tonic-build` and written to `api/src/generated/`.

## Files

- `README.md` -- API overview, service descriptions, design points, and code generation workflow
- `udex.index.v1.proto` -- IndexService: index namespace lifecycle (create, describe, update, list, delete)
- `udex.entry.v1.proto` -- EntryService: context-to-key entry operations and bulk transactional writes
- `udex.healthz.v1.proto` -- HealthzService: server health check with status messages
